{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-431a8508753cf806cb0fadb39ce014f4a7608982d3785253","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"6008d9c3101b828efee58a82b7337362a84e86fbcf3ba9b596360d971f8eff0e","article_count":0,"full_text":"⊙ Act No. 21446 (March 5, 2026)\n\nSpecial Act on the Establishment of Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City\n\n[Main text not reproduced]\n\nADDENDA\n\nArticle 1 (Enforcement Date)\nThis Act shall enter into force on July 1, 2026. <Proviso not reproduced>\n\nArticles 2 through 15 not reproduced.\n\nArticle 16 (Amendments to Other Acts)\n① and ② not reproduced.\n③ The Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 1 and Article 2, subparagraph 1, each occurrence of \"Jeollanam-do\" is replaced with \"Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City\".\n④ through ⑮ not reproduced.\n\n[Enactment]\n\n◇ Reasons for Enactment\n\nThe former Jeollanam-do and Gwangju Metropolitan City are each to be abolished and Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City established with a status equivalent to that of Seoul Special Metropolitan City. This is intended to create a hub for global advanced industries of the future, including artificial intelligence (AI), energy and semiconductors, and achieve smart innovation in agriculture and fisheries; thereby to establish a key growth axis in the southern region capable of overcoming the system concentrated solely in the Seoul metropolitan area, realize substantive decentralization and fiscal self-reliance, and contribute to balanced national development and the promotion of public welfare.\n\n◇ Main Provisions\n\n(a) The former Jeollanam-do and Gwangju Metropolitan City are each abolished, and Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City is established and granted a status equivalent to that of Seoul Special Metropolitan City (Article 7).\n\n(b) A Support Committee for Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City is established under the Prime Minister to deliberate on matters concerning the City's performance objectives, evaluation, and related matters; the City shall have four deputy mayors (Articles 12 and 35(1)).\n\n(c) The Mayor of Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City shall establish and operate a balanced development fund to eliminate disparities between areas within the Integrated Special City and overlapping investments, and may, with a resolution of the City Council, issue local government bonds exceeding the limit under the Local Finance Act (Articles 57 and 58).\n\n(d) Special provisions are established concerning the establishment and operation of foreign educational institutions, the deemed granting of authorizations and permits relating to development projects, and local tax reductions and exemptions for the smooth implementation of development projects (Articles 73, 157, 161, and others).\n\n(e) The State may support the transition of the petrochemical industry and the shipbuilding industry, among others, and the Superintendent of Education of Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City shall provide education for democratic citizenship, including the Yeosu-Suncheon October 19 Incident and the May 18 Democratization Movement (Articles 265, 267, and 346).\n\n<Provided by the Ministry of Government Legislation>\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"40f24c6443a6263d5efd23b029d864aec909ce49f915831d6ae2e746b4452e87"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.json","sha256":"e79fe50b9bb7474586dda6fc7204392243b1fa6751411a4221e3d8aa75050dd2"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.selfcheck.json","sha256":"eab6e235942545f9d210baf30e7d96fd2dd7734dbaddc5a7881e5de402ae4fe0"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.units.parts\\amendment-text.txt","sha256":"68b87da87d19234dfb6b91cd26a363900f8f8fb11b1f59328d7394ae8c27b23f"},"unit_key":"amendment-text"},{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.units.parts\\enactment-amendment-reason.json","sha256":"7370a994b2580b7138fb621f51f5a1cdaccece7cf7c0f5df090febabeb610301"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\supplement\\act\\en.units.parts\\enactment-amendment-reason.selfcheck.json","sha256":"ba74ea519c07358d33b0085ddf7ad2ab6ebfd493363d0567395cd016cc60a484"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\